msgid "List layout"
msgstr "Disposition de la liste"

#: Views/AdminSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Admin.Views.AdminSettings.Edit"
msgid "Menu"
msgstr "Menu"

#: Views/AdminSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Admin.Views.AdminSettings.Edit"
msgid "Navigation menu behavior"
msgstr "Comportement du menu de navigation"

#: Views/AdminSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Admin.Views.AdminSettings.Edit"
msgid "Only the section of the current page is open, and opening a section closes the others."
msgstr "Seule la section de la page courante est ouverte, et l'ouverture d'une section ferme les autres."

#: Views/AdminSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Admin.Views.AdminSettings.Edit"
msgid "Persistent"
msgstr "Persistant"

#: Views/AdminSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Admin.Views.AdminSettings.Edit"
msgid "Sections stay open until you close them, from page to page, so several can be open at once."
msgstr "Les sections restent ouvertes jusqu'à ce que vous les fermiez d'une page à l'autre, afin que plusieurs puissent être ouvertes à la fois."

#: Views/AdminSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Admin.Views.AdminSettings.Edit"
msgid "Show breadcrumb"
msgstr "Afficher le Fil d'Ariane"

#: Views/AdminSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Admin.Views.AdminSettings.Edit"
msgid "The section holding the current page is always open, whichever behavior is chosen."
msgstr "La section contenant la page courante est toujours ouverte, quel que soit le comportement choisi."

#: Views/AdminSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Admin.Views.AdminSettings.Edit"
msgid "Use configuration default"
msgstr "Utiliser la valeur par défaut de la configuration"

#: Views/AdminSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Admin.Views.AdminSettings.Edit"
msgid "Whether a New menu is displayed in the admin menu."
msgstr "Si un menu Nouveau est affiché dans le menu d'administration."

#: Views/AdminSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Admin.Views.AdminSettings.Edit"
msgid "Whether a filter input is displayed above the admin menu."
msgstr "Si un menu Nouveau est affiché dans le menu d'administration."

#: Views/AdminSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Admin.Views.AdminSettings.Edit"
msgid "Whether each list shows a selector with the available layouts. A user's choice is kept in a cookie, per list, and applies to that user only. The layout above stays the one every list starts from."
msgstr "Indique si chaque liste affiche un sélecteur proposant les dispositions disponibles. Le choix de l'utilisateur est enregistré dans un cookie propre à chaque liste et ne s'applique qu'à cet utilisateur. La disposition ci-dessus reste celle utilisée par défaut pour chaque liste."

#: Views/AdminSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Admin.Views.AdminSettings.Edit"
msgid "Whether or not to display a theme toggler."
msgstr "Afficher/Masquer le commutateur de thème."

#: Views/AdminSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Admin.Views.AdminSettings.Edit"
msgid "Whether the breadcrumb trail is displayed on admin screens."
msgstr "Si le fil d'ariane est affiché sur les écrans d'administration."

#: Views/AdminSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Admin.Views.AdminSettings.Edit"
msgid "Whether the quick navigation palette (Ctrl+K / Cmd+K) is displayed."
msgstr "Si la palette de navigation rapide (Ctrl+K / Cmd+K) est affichée."

#: Views/AdminSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Admin.Views.AdminSettings.Edit"
msgid "Whether the titles are displayed in the top bar."
msgstr "Si les titres sont affichés dans la barre du haut."

